    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2987" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ăpertūra</span></b> , ae,
			f.
		aperio (only post Aug.). <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>An opening</i> (abstr.), <i><span class="en">Vitr. 4, 6 <i>fin.</i></span></i>; <i><span class="en">Dig. 28, 5,
				3</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>An opening</i> (concr.), <i>aperture</i>, <i>a hole</i>, <i><span class="en">Vitr. 5,
			5</span></i>; so <i><span class="en">id. 10, 9</span></i>: <i><span class="en">Vulg.
				Amos, 4, 3</span></i>; <i><span class="en">9, 11</span></i>.</div>
